Map {
  "1.0.0.0" => "Hey, Link, let's slice through these enemies
quick! It'll be easy with the Master Sword!",
  "1.0.1.0" => "Link may be too overconfident... I pray he
doesn't become reckless...",
  "1.0.2.0" => "Oh ho! Link! Did you find a shiny, new sword?
Mmm. I'd like to see it... Come to me!",
  "1.0.3.0" => "If Link falls, our hope is lost. We must
keep Link safe at all times!",
  "1.0.5.0" => "There should be three Magic Keeps in the
east and three in the west...",
  "1.0.6.0" => "I can sense the Magic Keeps as well.
We must capture them immediately!",
  "1.0.7.0" => "Ha... The Triforce is drawing nearer...",
  "1.0.8.0" => "How odd... I can feel an eerie presence
coming from somewhere in this area...",
  "1.0.9.0" => "An eerie presence? I feel only the aura
given off by the witch and her monsters.",
  "1.0.10.0" => "The Magic Keeps are spawning strong
enemies! We must do something!",
  "1.0.11.0" => "This situation grows worse with each passing
moment. We must capture those keeps!",
  "1.0.12.0" => "Whoa! The enemies we're facing have a lot
more power than we're used to!",
  "1.0.13.0" => "I was right... We must capture the Magic Keeps
to break the connection and weaken the magic!",
  "1.0.14.0" => "That should stop some of the enemies, but
we've got to capture more Magic Keeps!",
  "1.0.15.0" => "The order we capture the keeps in may change
how quickly the flow of magic is severed!",
  "1.0.16.0" => "The west is free of magic! We must refocus
our efforts on the eastern Magic Keeps!",
  "1.0.17.0" => "Master, cutting the Magic Keeps off from one
another will greatly improve our chances.",
  "1.0.18.0" => "The east is free of magic! We must refocus
our efforts on the western Magic Keeps!",
  "1.0.19.0" => "The Magic Keeps are proving a real challenge
in this battle. We must capture them.",
  "1.0.20.0" => "By capturing the center, all three Magic Keeps
were deactivated at once! That's the secret!",
  "1.0.21.0" => "Master, the magic pathways
have all been severed.",
  "1.0.22.0" => "Link, stop wasting your time with petty
brawls! Show me what that sword can do...",
  "1.0.23.0" => "Link, the doors have opened and Cia is inside!
This is it! Let's take her down! Swish-swosh!",
  "1.0.24.0" => "I can see the darkness in your heart...but can
you overcome it? Don't disappoint me, love!",
  "1.0.25.0" => "Oh no, Link. I shouldn't have egged you
on! Don't let this impostor get you!",
  "1.0.26.0" => "We must not leave Link to fend for
himself! Hurry! Before he's defeated!",
  "1.0.28.0" => "She's using the darkness in his heart against
him... There must be something we can do!",
  "1.0.29.0" => "More Dark Links have appeared?
We must stop them!",
  "1.0.30.0" => "Four evil versions of Link have appeared.
We should dispatch them immediately.",
  "1.0.31.0" => "Four of them?! Uh-oh. You're in some
deep gravel now...",
  "1.0.32.0" => "There. That should take care of all
those pesky Dark Links.",
  "1.0.33.0" => "It revived itself. How can we help Link
against an enemy that can't be killed?",
  "1.0.34.0" => "Let them wear themselves out...
Then the Triforce will be MINE!",
  "1.0.35.0" => "What--?! This can't be! He's come to claim
the Triforce of Power--!",
  "1.0.36.0" => "Uh-oh! Uh-oh! More enemies are appearing!",
  "1.0.37.0" => "We'll be annihilated... All troops, retreat!
Fall back immediately!",
  "1.0.38.0" => "We've got to fall back! C'mon, the rose garden
in the west should make for a good getaway!",
  "1.0.39.0" => "Quickly! Everyone, escape through the rose
garden in the west!",
  "1.0.40.0" => "The Dark Links are being revived in the
Sorceress's Room. We must capture it!",
  "1.0.41.0" => "Link! You have to defeat all those Dark
Links. Otherwise no one else can escape!",
  "1.0.42.0" => "Link! Choose your battles carefully!",
  "1.0.44.0" => "Master, all Dark Links have been
permanently eliminated. Well done!",
  "1.0.45.0" => "The Master Sword is radiating so much
power... Link, are you doing this?",
  "1.0.46.0" => "The Master Sword's true power must be
awakening!",
  "1.0.47.0" => "If I can no longer pull from the darkness
in Link's heart, then I'll pull from my own!",
  "1.0.48.0" => "Cia, stop it! You're working with magic
that no one can contain!",
  "1.0.49.0" => "Silence! I won't be lectured by a happy
little goody-goody like you!",
  "1.0.50.0" => "Link appears to be unscathed... Everyone,
we must make a hasty retreat!",
  "1.0.51.0" => "OK, fall back! We can escape through the
western rose garden!",
  "1.0.52.0" => "Princess Zelda is in trouble! Everyone, go
on ahead! I'll rescue her myself!",
  "1.0.53.0" => "Impa! My safety is not your priority! I
order you to retreat along with the others!",
  "1.0.54.0" => "M'lady...I understand. Be well without me.",
  "1.0.55.0" => "Ha ha ha... Did you think I'd let you run?",
  "1.0.56.0" => "By the goddesses... This power... It...
My body refuses to move!",
  "1.0.57.0" => "Link, time to return that favor and protect your
friends from evil! Smite him! Smite him good!",
  "1.0.58.0" => "This is far worse than I could have ever
imagined...",
  "1.0.59.0" => "Ha ha ha... How dismally depressing...
Would you care to struggle further?",
  "1.0.60.0" => "Nnh--! It's no use!",
  "1.0.61.0" => "Such a pity... Let me free you from the
misery of this world...",
  "1.0.62.0" => "This is NOT good... I'll go on ahead and
guide everyone to the escape point!",
  "1.0.63.0" => "Midna has begun leading us to safety.
We should follow her!",
  "1.0.64.0" => "Everyone, listen up! I've found our point of
escape! Just get to me and you'll be safe!",
  "1.0.66.0" => "I thank you for your courage.
You saved me from a terrible fate!",
  "1.0.67.0" => "You dare raise the blade of evil's bane to me?
So be it. Hyrule's blood will be on your hands.",
  "1.0.68.0" => "Don't give up now, Link! FIGHT!",
  "1.0.69.0" => "Link, c'mon, buddy. Keep your head in
the game! We can't lose now!",
  "1.0.70.0" => "Link! Oh no, Link! What will we do without
the hero?",
  "1.0.71.0" => "Oh... Link... How could it come to this...?",
  "1.0.72.0" => "And so our end comes in this horrible
place... Forgive me, everyone!",
  "1.0.73.0" => "Hrk--! I'm done for... I'm so sorry,
everyone!",
  "1.0.74.0" => "I never thought I'd end in a place like
this. Princess Zelda...I have failed you...",
  "1.0.75.0" => "HA! They got me... Brothers...avenge me!",
  "1.0.76.0" => "Master, I...cannot continue fighting... I feel
my power fading away...",
  "1.0.77.0" => "Guh... I messed up bad... I'm so sorry...
I didn't want it to end like this...",
  "1.0.78.0" => "If any one of us falls, this battle is lost...",
  "1.0.79.0" => "You always have to be the hero, huh?",
  "1.0.80.0" => "What's this...? Does anyone else feel an eerie
presence coming from somewhere nearby?",
  "1.0.81.0" => "The magic connection is back! That means
strong monsters are bound to appear!",
  "1.0.82.0" => "We must recapture the Magic Keeps and
sever their connection with one another!",
  "1.0.83.0" => "The Magic Keeps are ours again!
That should cut their connection!",
  "1.0.84.0" => "Take the Magic Keeps all you'd like.
We'll just keep taking them back!",
  "1.0.85.0" => "We did it! We beat back the Dark Link!",
  "1.0.86.0" => "Get going, everyone! I'll hold the enemy
back!",
  "1.0.87.0" => "Everyone else got away! You've got to
get away, too!",
  "1.0.88.0" => "We have to escape! There must be a way.",
  "1.0.89.0" => "We can't escape! Not like this!",
  "1.0.90.0" => "Looks like we're not escaping THAT easily!",
  "1.0.91.0" => "And we were so close to getting away.
This is bad...",
  "1.0.92.0" => "Everyone is giving it their all... I refuse to
fall when they're all counting on me!",
  "1.0.93.0" => "The enemy won't relent! How much longer
can we fight at this intensity...?",
  "1.0.94.0" => "Go, my minions! Reclaim the Magic Keeps
and reestablish their connection!",
  "13.0.0.0" => "We can't win this without Link...
Don't let him out of your sight!",
  "13.0.1.0" => "I can sense strong magic coming from the
Magic Keeps... We must capture them!",
  "13.0.2.0" => "There are three Magic Keeps in both the east
and the west. They're empowering the enemy!",
  "13.0.3.0" => "I knew it! Capturing a Magic Keep severs its
connection to the rest of its group of keeps!",
  "13.0.4.0" => "The west side has been taken care of. Now we
need to focus on the Magic Keeps in the east!",
  "13.0.5.0" => "The east side has been taken care of. Now we
need to focus on the Magic Keeps in the west!",
  "13.0.6.0" => "Wow! Capturing that middle keep disconnected
all three Magic Keeps at once! Good idea!",
  "13.0.7.0" => "More Dark Links have appeared...?
Everyone, be careful!",
  "13.0.8.0" => "We'll be cornered if we stay here... All
troops! Fall back! On the double!",
  "13.0.9.0" => "The Sorceress's Room is somehow reviving
the Dark Links! We have to capture that keep!",
  "13.0.10.0" => "Link! Know your limits!",
  "13.0.11.0" => "Link should be all right now. Everyone!
Let's fall back!",
  "13.0.12.0" => "Ugh... Such strength... We can't get away.",
  "13.0.13.0" => "Is...all hope lost...?",
  "13.0.14.0" => "Are we...too late...?",
  "13.0.15.0" => "Please... Carry on... For me...",
  "13.0.16.0" => "Oh no! If Link falls, we don't stand a
chance against Cia and her forces!",
  "13.0.17.0" => "The burden...was too great...",
  "13.0.18.0" => "We can't let a single one of our friends
fall if we hope to stand a chance!",
  "13.0.19.0" => "The fight was...too much...",
  "13.0.20.0" => "I thought...I could do more...",
  "13.0.21.0" => "I should have...known my limits...",
  "13.0.22.0" => "I got careless...",
  "13.0.23.0" => "Oh! Half of those Dark Links have been beaten!
Shall we take care of the remaining two?",
  "13.0.24.0" => "Oh my... Would it be easier to flee through
the rose garden in the west?",
  "13.0.25.0" => "Ooh... Ouchie... This is it for me...",
  "13.0.26.0" => "Link...wait! I'm coming too!",
  "13.0.27.0" => "Take back the Magic Keeps, and cut that
magical connection!",
  "13.0.28.0" => "What's this? I sense a strange presence
somewhere around here...",
  "13.0.29.0" => "The Magic Keeps have lost their power.
I think the connection is cut for good.",
}